sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MobileApp
    participant Camera as Camera API
    participant GPS as Location API
    participant Cloudinary
    participant GooglePlaces as Google Places API
    participant MisskeyBackend
    participant Database as PostgreSQL
    participant SendGrid
    participant Association

    User->>MobileApp: Open camera to report issue
    MobileApp->>Camera: Request camera access
    Camera-->>MobileApp: Camera permission granted
    MobileApp->>GPS: Request location permission
    GPS-->>MobileApp: Location permission granted
    
    User->>MobileApp: Capture photo
    MobileApp->>GPS: Capture GPS coordinates
    GPS-->>MobileApp: Return lat/lng coordinates
    MobileApp->>MobileApp: Extract EXIF metadata
    
    MobileApp->>GooglePlaces: Query nearby buildings (lat, lng)
    GooglePlaces-->>MobileApp: Return 2-3 building options
    
    MobileApp->>User: Display building selection options
    User->>MobileApp: Select building
    
    MobileApp->>User: Request issue category/description
    User->>MobileApp: Enter issue details
    
    MobileApp->>Cloudinary: Upload photo with metadata
    Note over MobileApp,Cloudinary: Include EXIF timestamp,<br/>location data, upload preset
    Cloudinary-->>MobileApp: Return photo URL
    
    MobileApp->>MisskeyBackend: Create post request
    Note over MobileApp,MisskeyBackend: Include photo URL, building ID,<br/>location, category, user ID
    
    MisskeyBackend->>MisskeyBackend: Validate photo metadata
    MisskeyBackend->>Database: Check if building exists
    alt Building does not exist
        MisskeyBackend->>Database: Create new building record
    else Building exists
        MisskeyBackend->>Database: Update building last_updated
    end
    
    MisskeyBackend->>Database: Create post with building association
    Database-->>MisskeyBackend: Return post ID
    
    MisskeyBackend->>Database: Lookup association contact info
    Database-->>MisskeyBackend: Return association email
    
    MisskeyBackend->>SendGrid: Send notification email
    Note over MisskeyBackend,SendGrid: Include building info,<br/>issue details, photo link
    SendGrid->>Association: Deliver email notification
    Association-->>SendGrid: Email read receipt (optional)
    
    MisskeyBackend->>Database: Log notification status
    MisskeyBackend-->>MobileApp: Return post creation success
    
    MobileApp->>User: Display confirmation message
